# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout, regardless
# of platform or local `core.autocrlf` setting. Without this, Windows checkouts
# with `core.autocrlf=true` reintroduce CRLF into working-tree files that are
# stored as LF, which makes Prettier's `format:check` (LF-only) fail against
# files that have no real content diff from HEAD.
* text=auto eol=lf
